looking like The Rock,"

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:13.680
and then posted a picture of you
side by side by The Rock and...

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.515 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.951 size:81% position:41%
I talked about this.
She claims she did not

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:19.419 size:75% position:38% line:92%
add that fanny pack,

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.688
but that seems
very clearly added in, in post.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We were sitting --
We were shooting --

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:25.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
I forget what scene
we were shooting,

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.660 size:75% position:38%
and I was dressed --
This is a costume.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.729
I didn't come to work like this.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:32.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is what
I was wearing on set,

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.967 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like --
and I was standing there,

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I go, "You guys,
do I look like The Rock?"

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.738
and she goes -- she didn't know
what I was talking about.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like Google it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Rock fanny pack,"
and she was like,

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.944 line:92%
"Please let me take a picture!"

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.514 line:92%
And then drew in the fanny pack.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:48.314 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That is fantastic.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
Also fantastic,
you wrote a book.

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:51.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did.
-Congratulations.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-I did. Thanks.

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:57.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So Close to Being the [bleep]
Y'all Don't Even Know."

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:58.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
How did you come up
with the title,

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So Close to Being the [bleep]
Y'all Don't Even Know"?

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's just my life.
-Yeah.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm so close
to being the [bleep]

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:05.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
y'all don't even know.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.932 --> 00:01:08.802
-Don't you feel like people --
more people are getting close

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:10.503 line:92%
to knowing now every year?

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:12.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you know what?
When I was writing this,

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
I started this
when I was in Vancouver

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:19.279
doing "Girlfriends Guide,"
and that was the kind of thing.

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:20.013 size:84% position:42% line:92%
The show was gonna end.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:23.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't know if I was gonna
have a job after that.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:24.918 line:92%
And it was the kind of thing --

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.752 line:92%
But I was like -- I was antsy.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "I know,
it's coming, it's coming,

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:28.154 line:92%
it's coming, it's coming."

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:31.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so this job came
after I finished the book.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:36.996
So there was all this press,
my face was in Times Square,

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:40.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I was like,
"The book was right!

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.502 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
A bitch close!"

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.003 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:45.171 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, what I like
about this book is,

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.543 size:88% position:44%
obviously, it's very --
you have a very positive

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.312
